    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features crafting, interior base-building, dynamic weather and weather events, a vast world filled with explorable locations, and various terrifying creatures to study, evade, and eventually - fight.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> locations such as scientific research laboratories, makeshift shelters, crashed airplanes, downed survey craft, and more - each offering valuable resources and, more importantly, clues as to where the creatures came from and how the world ended up this way. And who knows - maybe even a chance at gaining the upper hand\u2026 and making it out alive\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> up your base, bring back recovered equipment, and establish a perimeter and sources of heat to prepare for longer, more dangerous ventures deeper into the cold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> by staying warm - loot crates for wood and build fires. Keep hunger at bay through hunting and fishing. Avoid lethal hazards and enemies that are beyond your reach\u2026 for now. Study the creatures to uncover their weaknesses. Craft weapons and tools - like bows and spears - to defend yourself against everything that can, and will, try to kill you.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features crafting, interior base-building, dynamic weather and weather events, a vast world filled with explorable locations, and various terrifying creatures to study, evade, and eventually - fight.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> locations such as scientific research laboratories, makeshift shelters, crashed airplanes, downed survey craft, and more - each offering valuable resources and, more importantly, clues as to where the creatures came from and how the world ended up this way. And who knows - maybe even a chance at gaining the upper hand\u2026 and making it out alive\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> up your base, bring back recovered equipment, and establish a perimeter and sources of heat to prepare for longer, more dangerous ventures deeper into the cold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> by staying warm - loot crates for wood and build fires. Keep hunger at bay through hunting and fishing. Avoid lethal hazards and enemies that are beyond your reach\u2026 for now. Study the creatures to uncover their weaknesses. Craft weapons and tools - like bows and spears - to defend yourself against everything that can, and will, try to kill you.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Venture into the desolate frozen wasteland in this open-world survival horror. Struggle to survive in the cold, where strange creatures roam in the darkness. Build a shelter, collect supplies, fend off unimaginable threats, and fight for survival After Hell Freezes Over.",
